 "summary": "FVH is a standard-grade family of polarised aluminum electrolytic chip capacitors in a can on a plastic base plate for reflow mounting. Ratings run from 4 V to 450 V and 0.1 µF to 6800 µF in cans from 4 × 5.4 mm to 16 × 16.5 mm, rated for 2000 hours at 105 °C with rated voltage applied. Each rating lists its case and its maximum ripple current at 105 °C and 120 Hz; several ratings also come in a smaller alternative case with a lower ripple current.",
